      "content": "i get that, but it feels like you're saying one side is based on \"credible sources\" while the other is just \"misinformation.\" isn't there a middle ground where people aren't just lying, but actually have legitimate scientific disagreements about things like mask efficacy or vaccine transmission? it feels like calling all those arguments misinformation might be skipping over the actual debate that was happening.",
